gb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><div class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-efgrtk" data-styles-preset="UEGY8Anrt" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">DESTINATIONS SERVED</div></div><div class="framer-19vm7g8" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">Italy, France, Greece, with  destinations every year.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-1sujhf3" data-framer-name="Bottom" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div class="framer-7b6ihv" data-framer-name="Line"></div><div class="framer-1mp5310" data-framer-name="Line"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="framer-9gasz3" data-framer-name="About"><div class="framer-1rt4azs" data-framer-name="Container"><div class="framer-1euhpz1" data-framer-name="Left"><div class="ssr-variant"><div class="framer-1y9zf55" style="will-change:transform;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) max(max((min(max(100vw, 1px), 1460px) - 160px) / 2, 50px), 1px), (max-width: 809.98px) max(max(min(max(100vw, 1px), 1460px) - 40px, 50px), 1px), (min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(max((min(max(100vw, 1px), 1460px) - 90px) / 2, 50px), 1px)" srcset="https://framerusercontent.com/images/djGZDk8iAigEwQWF4YwVo6ko0.jpg?scale-down-to=512&amp;width=800&amp;height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/djGZDk8iAigEwQWF4YwVo6ko0.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800 800w" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/djGZDk8iAigEwQWF4YwVo6ko0.jpg?width=800&amp;height=800" alt="Image" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div></div><div class="framer-1ypp8hz" data-framer-name="Testimonial" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div class="framer-1qpo6ca" data-framer-name="Bottom"><div class="framer-1xwtmw4" data-framer-name="Content"><div class="framer-q8y5eb" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">"I don't plan weddings. I craft the days you'll relive forever."</p></div><div class="framer-kl0f8a" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1pg24c3" data-styles-preset="Tdj7oupmF" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">— Elara, founder</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-6w698f" data-framer-name="Right"><div class="framer-sefnbm" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><h2 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xj1ajo" data-styles-preset="xJxHrTFcn" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">More than a planner A creative partner</h2></div><div class="framer-2egx8x" data-framer-name="Bottom"><div class="framer-1ucubo3" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">With fourteen years in luxury weddings across Europe, I specialise in celebrations that feel deeply personal and effortlessly elegant never a template, always you.</p></div><div class="framer-tww8hg" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">I founded Elara Events in 2013, built on a simple belief your wedding should feel like you, not a template. I work with an intimate circle of trusted vendors across Europe, each sharing my obsession with quality.</p></div><div class="framer-7wymc4" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1hzyyu" data-styles-preset="llnrlzWbI" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:left">Fourteen years later, 280+ celebrations, six countries and still, every new couple brings something I haven't seen before. That's the part that keeps me going.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="framer-18ge0mq" data-framer-name="Step"><div class="framer-bmcr7b" data-framer-name="Container"><div class="ssr-variant hidden-5ic72w hidden-18f3y2p"><div class="framer-1rs4ufb-container" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div class="framer-Pa9WL framer-9JEq0 framer-f0IiP framer-GDgi6 framer-17v76k3 framer-v-17v76k3" data-framer-name="Default" style="background-color:var(--token-c097e3f4-c9df-4654-a9f5-b176c62c47d7, rgb(238, 231, 225));height:100%;width:100%"><div class="framer-j842dr" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;opacity:0.5;transform:none"><h2 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1xj1ajo" data-styles-preset="xJxHrTFcn" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">01</h2></div><div class="framer-yfdpuc" data-framer-name="Bottom"><div class="framer-1h19oy3" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><h3 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-fyg8nu" data-styles-preset="nY